    {
      "id": "claim_de3f3645b42f4657a2865f0313ca8aef",
      "statement": "Recorded surfaces: a span per stateless Worker request, per cell event (fetch/alarm/RPC/WebSocket message), per outbound fetch, and per cell start, carrying request id/cell/isolate/queue wait/outbound URL+status/durability facts; every console.log line becomes a log record correlated to the handler's trace/span ids even across await; inbound and outbound W3C traceparent headers are honored so calls chain into one trace; no metrics are recorded today.",
